imProcessCreate
| where (TargetProcessCommandLine contains "&&set" and TargetProcessCommandLine contains "cmd" and TargetProcessCommandLine contains "/c" and TargetProcessCommandLine contains "-f") and (TargetProcessCommandLine contains "{0}" or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "{1}" or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "{2}" or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "{3}" or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "{4}" or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "{5}")